"terms_of_use_title" = "Terms of Use";
"privacy_policy_content" = "<b>Last updated: March 26, 2026</b>\n\nVolleyStream Pro (\\"the App\\") is developed to allow the streaming of sports events and real-time score management. Your privacy is important to us.\n\n<b>1. Data Controller</b>\nThe data controller is: <b>VolleyStream Pro</b>. Email: <b>volleystreampro@gmail.com</b>\n\n<b>2. Data Collected</b>\n<b>2.1 Camera and Microphone</b>\nThe app requires access to: Camera, Microphone. Use: For live streaming on YouTube and optional local recording. Important: No audio/video content is saved on our servers. The stream is sent directly to Google (YouTube).\n\n<b>2.2 Google Account and YouTube</b>\nThe app uses Google login to enable streaming. Data collected: Email address, Account ID / YouTube channel ID, Access Token (OAuth). Use: User authentication, Start streaming on the selected channel. Sharing: Only with Google for the service to function.\n\n<b>2.3 Firebase (Remote control and score)</b>\nWe use Google Firebase for data synchronization. Data processed: Team names, Score, Match status. Features: Temporary data (lasts only during the match), Encryption in transit (HTTPS), Protected access (anonymous or controlled authentication).\n\n<b>2.4 Subscriptions and payments</b>\nAll payments are handled by Google Play. Important: We do not collect payment data, we do not have access to cards or IBAN.\n\n<b>2.5 Local Video Recording</b>\nThe app offers the option to save a copy of the live stream on your device. The video is saved locally and no data is transmitted to external servers. The user has full control over the files.\n\n<b>3. Legal Basis (GDPR)</b>\nWe process data based on: User consent, Execution of the requested service, Legal obligations (if applicable).\n\n<b>4. How we use the data</b>\nWe use the data exclusively to: Live streaming on YouTube, Score management and direction, Synchronization between devices, Subscription verification.\n\n<b>5. Data Retention</b>\nNo personal data is stored on our servers. Firebase data is temporary. Local data is deleted upon uninstallation.\n\n<b>6. Security</b>\nWe adopt adequate technical measures: Local encryption (EncryptedSharedPreferences), Secure connections (HTTPS), Firebase access protection.\n\n<b>7. User Rights</b>\nYou have the right to: Access to your data, Deletion, Revocation of consent, Limitation of processing. Email: <b>volleystreampro@gmail.com</b>\n\n<b>8. Revoke Google Access</b>\nYou can revoke access at any time from: myaccount.google.com/permissions\n\n<b>9. Third-party services used</b>\nThe app uses: Google Play Services, YouTube API Services, Firebase (Google). Use of the app implies acceptance of Google's policies as well.\n\n<b>10. Changes to the policy</b>\nWe may update this policy. Changes will be published on this page.";
"terms_of_use_content" = "<![CDATA[\n<b>Last updated: March 10, 2026</b><br><br>\nPlease read these Terms of Use carefully before using <b>VolleyStreamPro</b>.<br><br>\n<b>1. App License and Use</b><br>\nWe grant you a limited, non-exclusive license to use the App for personal or professional sports streaming purposes.<br><br>\n<b>2. Subscription and Billing</b><br>\n• <b>Annual Subscription:</b> Requires an active subscription via Google Play.<br>\n• <b>Auto-Renewal:</b> Renews automatically unless turned off 24 hours before the end of the period.<br><br>\n<b>3. User Responsibilities</b><br>\nYou use the App at your own risk. You agree to stream only content for which you own the copyrights or necessary authorizations.<br><br>\n<b>4. Limitation of Liability</b><br>\nWe are not responsible for any indirect damages or internet connection stability issues during your live streams.<br><br>\n<b>6. Contacts</b><br>\nvolleystreampro@gmail.com\n    ]]>";
